Package: olereader
Title: Read OLE Compound Files
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ethan", family = "Bass", email = "ethanbass@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6175-6739"))
Description: Reads Microsoft compound files, also known as OLE2 or
    structured storage files, in pure R. Lists the streams in a file,
    returns their contents as raw vectors and extracts them to disk.
    Written from the MS-CFB specification
    <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/openspecs/windows_protocols/ms-cfb/>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ethanbass/olereader, https://ethanbass.github.io/olereader/
BugReports: https://github.com/ethanbass/olereader/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
